extends ../../base-email

block content
  tr
    td(style="padding: 40px 40px 32px;")
      // Heading
      h1(style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 32px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Reset your password
      
      // Greeting
      p(style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Hi 
        span(style="font-weight: 500;")= name
        | ,
      
      // Main message
      p(style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | We received a request to reset your password for your Pacepard account. Click the button below to choose a new password.
      
      // Button
      table(cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0;")
        tr
          td
            a(href=resetLink style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 24px; background-color: #1A73E8; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;") Reset password
      
      // Expiry notice
      p(style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | This link will expire in 
        span(style="font-weight: 500; color: #202124;")= expiry
        | . If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
      
      // Alternative link
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #E8EAED; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
        br
        a(href=resetLink style="color: #1A73E8; text-decoration: none; word-break: break-all;")= resetLink
      
      // Security notice
      p(style="margin: 24px 0 0; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #E8EAED; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #5F6368; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | For your security, never share this link with anyone.
      
      // Closing
      p(style="margin: 32px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #202124; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;")
        | Thanks,
        br
        span(style="font-weight: 500;") The Pacepard Team
